# The shocklands' "As this land enters, you may pay 2 life" (Breeding Pool, Godless Shrine, Hallowed Fountain share it):
# a player can pay life only if their life total is at least the amount (CR 119.4), so at 1 life the choice is not
# offered and the land enters tapped. Bot1 pays for Breeding Pool on turn 1 (18) and for Godless Shrine on turn 3
# (4, after Bot2's four Bolts took it to 6), Bot2's fifth Bolt makes it 1, and turn 5's Hallowed Fountain is not
# asked about and enters tapped. The two paid lands entered untapped (the positive controls).

[Bot1 Deck]
Breeding Pool
Godless Shrine
Hallowed Fountain
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain x12

